| !Run for !FFmpeg (FFmpeg 5.1.10 LTS for RISC OS)
| Double-clicking !FFmpeg sets up the *ffmpeg, *ffprobe and *ffplay
| commands (as !Boot does), checks the modules they need, and puts the
| FFmpeg icon on the icon bar: drop a video or sound file on it to play it.
Set FFmpeg$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Run <FFmpeg$Dir>.!Boot

| --- Runtime support -------------------------------------------------
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error FFmpeg needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error FFmpeg needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
| Sound: SharedSoundBuffer, StreamManager and SharedSound (John Duffell's
| ssb.zip, from the RDPClient page at orac.co.uk). Merged into !System they
| still have to be loaded: these do it (and are quiet if they're missing).
RMEnsure SharedSound 1.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSound Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSound
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 IfThere System:Modules.StreamMan Then RMLoad System:Modules.StreamMan
RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSBuffer Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSBuffer

| --- The icon bar front end (one copy; it checks) -------------------
WimpSlot -min 512K -max 512K
Run <FFmpeg$Dir>.!RunImage
